
This directory contains the rcsh, the remore access version of csh.  With rcsh,
we can do remote name substitution and I/O redirection as well as other functions
of csh.  It ds the csh to do name substitution and I/O redirection remotely.
It is also an example of reloading existing programs with libra.a.

Those source codes which are unchanged are not listed in this directory.  Users
should make symbolic links to their source files (in /usr/src/bin/csh)
before running the Makefile.

See also the manual page rcsh(1R).

